From: pessi-v <pessimo@posteo.net>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:31:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] (lilac) camera: report laser autofocus as focused-locked

With the laser rangefinder in range, the yoshino HAL sets the AF mode to
OFF and drives the lens from the ToF distance, so every result carries
AF_MODE_OFF / AF_STATE_INACTIVE. The vendor workaround (a fake AF state
in the partial results) does not reach Android 11's FrameProcessor,
which keeps the final value, so autoFocus() never completes and the
camera app's shutter waits forever.

In process3aState(), when the result says AF_MODE_OFF but the API1
client asked for an autofocus mode, report FOCUSED_LOCKED: the lens is
already positioned by the laser. A new trigger id is still required, so
idle frames do nothing.
---
 .../libcameraservice/api1/client2/FrameProcessor.cpp   | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/camera/libcameraservice/api1/client2/FrameProcessor.cpp b/services/camera/libcameraservice/api1/client2/FrameProcessor.cpp
index 2daacd16af1335bfdc8662755dc621c67bd1b572..745be3f9185b8c420cee24de0864f147f0b35b63 100644
--- a/services/camera/libcameraservice/api1/client2/FrameProcessor.cpp
+++ b/services/camera/libcameraservice/api1/client2/FrameProcessor.cpp
@@ -287,6 +287,24 @@ status_t FrameProcessor::process3aState(const CaptureResult &frame,
             &pendingState.awbState, frameNumber, cameraId);
 
     pendingState.afTriggerId = frame.mResultExtras.afTriggerId;
+
+    // lilac: laser (ToF) focus. The HAL drives the lens from the laser distance, reports
+    // AF_MODE_OFF and an INACTIVE AF_STATE forever, so an API1 autoFocus() trigger would never
+    // complete. If the client asked for an autofocus mode, report the lens as locked.
+    if (gotAFState && pendingState.afMode == ANDROID_CONTROL_AF_MODE_OFF &&
+            pendingState.afState != ANDROID_CONTROL_AF_STATE_FOCUSED_LOCKED) {
+        Parameters::focusMode_t clientFocusMode;
+        {
+            SharedParameters::Lock l(client->getParameters());
+            clientFocusMode = l.mParameters.focusMode;
+        }
+        if (clientFocusMode == Parameters::FOCUS_MODE_AUTO ||
+                clientFocusMode == Parameters::FOCUS_MODE_MACRO ||
+                clientFocusMode == Parameters::FOCUS_MODE_CONTINUOUS_PICTURE ||
+                clientFocusMode == Parameters::FOCUS_MODE_CONTINUOUS_VIDEO) {
+            pendingState.afState = ANDROID_CONTROL_AF_STATE_FOCUSED_LOCKED;
+        }
+    }
     pendingState.aeTriggerId = frame.mResultExtras.precaptureTriggerId;
 
     if (gotAEState && (frameNumber > mLastAEFrameNumber)) {
